#: R/diagnosticmeta.b.R
msgid ""
"%d rows share %d study identifier(s) (%s). Rows that share an identifier "
"usually describe one cohort read several times - by several pathologists, at "
"several cut-offs or by several algorithms - and so share participants. They "
"are pooled here as separate studies, which counts those participants more "
"than once and makes the confidence intervals too narrow. Keep one "
"pre-specified 2x2 table per independent study, for example the primary "
"reader or the pre-specified threshold."
msgstr ""

