msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: its percentage CI "
"cannot be computed because the comparison mean cannot be distinguished from "
"zero (estimate %s%%)."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: region '%s' differs "
"by an estimated %s%% of the comparison mean (90%% CI %s%% to %s%%); "
"agreement within the %s%% margin needs the whole 90%% CI inside it."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: regions '%s' and "
"'%s' differ by an estimated %s%% of their mean (90%% CI %s%% to %s%%); "
"agreement within the %s%% margin needs the whole 90%% CI inside it."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: the difference "
"between region '%s' and its comparison changes with the level, an estimated "
"%s where the mean of the two measurements is %s (90%% CI %s to %s) and %s at "
"%s (90%% CI %s to %s); agreement within the ±%s margin needs both CIs inside "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: the difference "
"between the mean of all regions and the reference changes with the level, an "
"estimated %s where the mean of the two measurements is %s (90%% CI %s to %s) "
"and %s at %s (90%% CI %s to %s); agreement within the ±%s margin needs both "
"CIs inside it."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"A systematic difference was neither ruled out nor shown: the mean of all "
"regions differs by an estimated %s%% of the reference mean (90%% CI %s%% to "
"%s%%); agreement within the %s%% margin needs the whole 90%% CI inside it."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
