#: package.description
msgid ""
"Oncology and pathology analyses from the ClinicoPath project: swimmer plots "
"of patient timelines with response rates and follow-up; waterfall and spider "
"plots of tumour burden response (thresholds adapted from RECIST v1.1, not a "
"lesion-level RECIST assessment); diagnostic test accuracy meta-analysis with "
"bivariate and proportional-hazards SROC models; and regional heterogeneity "
"of an immunohistochemistry marker, against a reference or between regions. "
"For comments, suggestions, feature requests or reporting bugs, please open "
"an issue at <https://github.com/sbalci/OncoPath/issues/>."
msgstr ""

