#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"Systematic differences between regions were assessed for every pair of "
"regions with paired t-tests (mean difference with 95%% CI) and Bland-Altman "
"95%% limits of agreement, each difference expressed as a percentage of the "
"mean of the two regions. With a margin of %s%%, the regions were judged to "
"agree when the 90%% CI of every pair lay within the margin (two one-sided "
"tests), and a pair was considered material when a CI adjusted for the number "
"of pairs (Bonferroni) lay entirely beyond it; the CIs of the percentage "
"difference are Fieller intervals."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
msgid ""
"Systematic differences between the two regions were assessed with a paired "
"t-test (mean difference with 95%% CI) and Bland-Altman 95%% limits of "
"agreement, the difference expressed as a percentage of the mean of the two "
"regions. With a margin of %s%%, a difference was ruled out when its 90%% CI "
"lay within the margin (two one-sided tests) and considered material when "
"that CI lay entirely beyond it; the CIs of the percentage difference are "
"Fieller intervals."
msgstr ""

#: R/ihcheterogeneity.b.R
